PianoDp is new code for UniXNU-piano (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, LICENSE): USB-C DisplayPort Alt Mode (backlog B8), the first slices D1
(the read-only survey), D2 (the port events) and D6's shared part (DpFake.h, used by NativeGopDisplay). What it takes from other work,
and from where:

UniXNU-piano (this repository), BSD-2-Clause-Patent:
